      "@type": "AnalogicalMapping",
      "instance_name": "jewish_invention_mapping",
      "label": "The text 'Jewish invention' is mapped onto the visual of the burning World Trade Center towers.",
      "description": "The meme uses the visual of the World Trade Center during the 9/11 attacks to analogically represent the textual claim that the event was a 'Jewish invention.' This mapping falsely attributes the catastrophic event to Jewish people, which is an antisemitic conspiracy theory. The visual material (the burning towers) is mapped onto the textual material ('Jewish invention') to create a false equivalence, implying that the Jewish people are responsible for the destruction depicted.",
